    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33573" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλελεῦ</span></b> , doubled <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλελεῦ
